OL,3,GNEWSAWidow says cafe trips with
OL,4,Astrangers are a lifesaver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA widow who attends a cafe where
OL,7,Fcustomers are encouraged to share
OL,8,Ftables with strangers said it had been
OL,9,Fa "lifesaver".
OL,11,FLydia Martin, from Brackley, encouraged
OL,12,Fher husband Brian to go to the sessions
OL,13,Fto make new friends after he retired,
OL,14,Fbefore he died, but she never expected
OL,15,Fto go herself.
OL,17,F"Chatty Cafe was Brian's lifesaver for
OL,18,Fa while, and it has become my lifesaver
OL,19,Fas well," she said.
