OL,3,GNEWSAWidow says cafe trips with
OL,4,Astrangers are a lifesaver
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chatty Cafe scheme, which started
OL,7,Fin 2017, is a free social enterprise
OL,8,Fthat helps tackle loneliness by
OL,9,Fencouraging people to meet and share
OL,10,Fconversations with strangers in their
OL,11,Fcommunity.
